+; anything else cancels with the before-download exit code.
+; Same shape as finishInstallChoice.
+Function welcomeChoice
+  Pop $0
+  ${If} $0 == "1"
+    StrCpy $R9 1
+    Call RelativeGotoPage
+  ${Else}
+    ; ExitProcess, not Quit: Quit from inside a WebBrowser callback
+    ; does not terminate (the quit flag never gets actioned there).
+    ; Nothing to clean up at welcome time. Exit code = cancel-before-download.
